// Oren compiler driver (x64-focused; self-hosting friendly)
//
// This variant uses the same pipeline as `lib/compiler/compiler.oren`, but swaps
// the arm64 native backends for small stubs so x64 compiler builds stay bounded.
//
// Intended use:
// - Build x64-linux and x64-windows compiler binaries (ELF/PE) for Tier‑1 self-hosting.
// - Not intended to emit arm64 native binaries.

